  dropped the first ~16).

  Coverage note: the captured window starts AFTER the session's
  first heartbeat (active=1) was evicted from the MCP cache. This
  is a cache-window artefact, not a session anomaly — the counters
  are monotonic and increment every physics tick, so divergence at
  any skipped heartbeat would have propagated into the captured
  window. Zero divergence on all 17 captured heartbeats implies
  zero divergence across the session.

  skip-ticks=0 on every heartbeat: modifier always runs when
  RunInputs reaches motor.cs:348, so the "both sides idle" branch
  never fires after Phase 3c's anyRan extension. Expected behavior.

